      "summaries": {
        "en": "This project provides reference architectures for building GPU-accelerated vision agents that search and summarize video content. It combines large language models (LLMs) with retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and vision-language models (VLMs) to enable natural language queries over video data. Technically, it uses NVIDIA's AI frameworks to efficiently process video streams, extract key frames, and generate summaries. Developers can deploy these blueprints to create applications like automated video surveillance analysis, content moderation, or video archive search, leveraging GPU acceleration for real-time performance.",
        "zh": "该项目提供了一套参考架构，用于构建GPU加速的视觉智能体，实现视频内容的搜索与摘要。它结合大语言模型（LLM）、检索增强生成（RAG）和视觉语言模型（VLM），让用户能用自然语言查询视频数据。技术上，它利用NVIDIA的AI框架高效处理视频流，提取关键帧并生成摘要。开发者可基于这些蓝图构建应用，如自动化视频监控分析、内容审核或视频档案搜索，借助GPU加速实现实时性能。核心优势在于将多模态AI与硬件加速结合，降低了视频分析应用的开发门槛。",
        "es": "This project provides reference architectures for building GPU-accelerated vision agents that search and summarize video content. It combines large language models (LLMs) with retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and vision-language models (VLMs) to enable natural language queries over video data. Technically, it uses NVIDIA's AI frameworks to efficiently process video streams, extract key frames, and generate summaries. Developers can deploy these blueprints to create applications like automated video surveillance analysis, content moderation, or video archive search, leveraging GPU acceleration for real-time performance.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "video-search-and-summarization stands out for agents, llm, and rag in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "This project provides reference architectures for building GPU-accelerated vision agents that search and summarize video content. It combines large language models (LLMs) with retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and vision-language models (VLMs) to enable natural language queries over video data. Technically, it uses NVIDIA's AI frameworks to efficiently process video streams, extract key frames, and generate summaries. Developers can deploy these blueprints to create applications like automated video surveillance analysis, content moderation, or video archive search, leveraging GPU acceleration for real-time performance.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/NVIDIA-AI-Blueprints/video-search-and-summarization for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
