        "zh": "Qwen3.6-27B是一个多模态对话模型，能够同时处理图像和文本，实现关于视觉内容的自然对话。其核心技术在于统一的视觉-语言预训练，无需独立的视觉编码器即可理解复杂场景并回答问题。你可以在Hugging Face上通过Transformers库直接部署，用于图像描述、视觉问答或基于图片的交互式聊天。尝试用它构建能讨论照片或图表的AI助手，体验多模态对话的便捷。",
        "es": "Qwen3.6-27B is a multimodal conversational model that processes both images and text, enabling natural dialogue about visual content. Its key innovation lies in unified vision-language pretraining, allowing it to understand complex scenes and answer questions without separate vision encoders. You can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like image captioning, visual question answering, or interactive chat with image inputs. Try it for building AI assistants that discuss photos or diagrams.",
